<title>POLAND: KETY APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 2.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>KETY APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 2.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.67 vs   3.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.21 vs   5.09</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.16 vs   4.12</p>
<p> Sales		   41.04 vs  30.33</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.93 vs  11.35</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	15.73 vs  19.01</p>
<p> Operating profit    16.16 vs  16.45</p>
<p> Sales		  142.91 vs 121.67</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish aluminium plant is Zaklady</p>
<p>Metali Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
